d":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-02-25T14:09:53Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T15:17:32Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4-rc1 and v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.rc.mono (54c1a1ea8) - Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS 24.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen adding a node to an inherited scene and moving it 'above' or in 'between' the inherited child node, the node is still added after the inherited child nodes. The same is true for 'editable children'. The draw order is respected.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe mrp contains a parent containing a `ColorRect`. The child scene inherits from the parent scene and adds an additional `ColorRect` as first child:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b137065-c8b9-4b49-8a04-a3f0e05ab7be)\n\nThe `ColorRect`s print to the output when `_enter_tree` and `_ready` are called. The parents `ColorRect` functions are always called before the childs. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7cd8c4b-4836-4582-9069-5196503251ee)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18965810/mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103282/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}